VEQDB licensing
===============

Author-created VEQDB dataset content is released under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), as recorded in the Figshare deposit:
https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.34485114
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The standalone compact-record codec under src/veqdb/ retains the BSD 3-Clause
licence and copyright notice in LICENSES/veqpy-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
The Figure 3 verification script scripts/verify_figure3_pressure.py is also
distributed under this BSD 3-Clause licence.

Third-party material retains its applicable upstream terms. Source repositories
and retained notices are identified in SOURCE_DATA.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
Other software is covered by its own applicable notices.
